# loop-budget

Apply the loop-budget skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- declare loop budgets up front
- detect degenerate loops (repeats, ping-pong, format errors)
- record an append-only loop ledger and route on the typed verdict

Stop when: Budget declared, loop executed, and the run ended with a typed LoopBudgetVerdict plus an append-only ledger; the caller routes on exitStatus.
